  <!-- ================================================================
       Second-chance housing directory (/housing)

       The 51 state pages are listed unconditionally, including states
       with no listings yet. Each one is a real page that answers a real
       query ("housing with a felony in Ohio") with the state's lookback
       summary and the national fallbacks, so it is worth indexing
       before it has listings — and adding a state to this file later,
       once it fills up, would mean it was invisible during exactly the
       period somebody was searching for it.

       Published ORGANIZATION pages are generated between the markers
       below by `npm run housing:sitemap`. Do not hand-edit that block.
